1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
A drafted suitability report is only as fast to approve as it is easy to trust.

2
00:00:05,449 --> 00:00:07,621
This is the Suitability Evidence Desk.

3
00:00:07,671 --> 00:00:11,772
Six synthetic cases, each with a readiness state and the reason for it.

4
00:00:12,221 --> 00:00:15,245
Every sentence in the draft carries evidence chips.

5
00:00:15,295 --> 00:00:19,403
Click one and the exact transcript line or fact-find field lights up.

6
00:00:20,588 --> 00:00:23,468
Figures, dates and charges are deterministic:

7
00:00:23,518 --> 00:00:25,877
checked by code, with the rule shown.

8
00:00:25,927 --> 00:00:28,546
Reasons and objectives are probabilistic:

9
00:00:28,596 --> 00:00:31,671
evidence strength only, and the adviser decides.

10
00:00:32,121 --> 00:00:35,743
Here the charge says five hundred and forty pounds.

11
00:00:35,793 --> 00:00:40,639
One and a half percent of thirty thousand is four hundred and fifty.

12
00:00:40,689 --> 00:00:42,727
The check fails and says why.

13
00:00:43,178 --> 00:00:45,756
Edit a number and the checks re-run instantly.

14
00:00:45,806 --> 00:00:50,441
Twenty-five thousand breaks the ISA allowance and no longer matches the fact-find.

15
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:56,053
A sentence with no evidence is flagged unsupported, and the report cannot be approved.

16
00:00:56,501 --> 00:00:59,967
The vulnerability panel uses the F C A’s four drivers.

17
00:01:00,017 --> 00:01:02,245
The client mentioned a bereavement.

18
00:01:02,295 --> 00:01:05,435
Confirm it, and her own words go into the report.

19
00:01:05,888 --> 00:01:11,225
Nothing is sent without a named adviser, a declaration, and an audit trail you can export.

20
00:01:11,675 --> 00:01:19,663
On twenty-four synthetic golden cases, the checker caught all twenty-one seeded defects, with a two point four percent false-positive rate.

21
00:01:19,713 --> 00:01:23,942
Vulnerability recall is eighty percent, and the miss is shown, not hidden.
